A||||45||Archie||Fino & Finale didn't make it to Dells||||13||
Z||000000||Archie||06-03-2001||09:09 PM||||As many know we now manufacture the Fino & Finale body kits for the Fiero. This weekend was supposed to be a very special weekend for us. It would have been the 1st time ever that a completed Fino and completed Finale were displayed together at ANY Show in the World. Previously no one has ever had a Fino & a Finale at the same time at the same show.<P>Well that was not to be, at least for now.<P>As many have heard neither of the cars made it to the Dells show this weekend.<P>When being preped for the drive to the show, your's truely, forgot to install the 2 tiny "E" clips that would retain the hinge pins that hold the large back window into the Finale.<P>So here is what happened, at about 80mph on I-90 while we were driving the cars to the show. I was driving the lead car (Finale) in the passing lane going around a Semi. When the hinge pins viberated out of place and large rear window (& frame) took a little trip of it's own. Lifted by the wind, it rolled end over end appox. 30+ foot in the air. My Fino was about 100 yards behind & As luck would have it, the airborne item landed squarely on the windshield of the Fino. <P>Other than the rear window and frame being gone, the Red Finale suffered no other damage. The Fino however, didn't do so well with it's windshield caved in, gouges to the "T" top and extensive paint/fiberglass damage.<P>We did manage to make it to the show with my "3rd. back-up car".<P>Several people asked me to put up some pics., so here they are.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/345.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/346.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/348.jpg"> <P>Thank You<P>Archie||||reg||13
Z||000001||Galen||06-03-2001||09:15 PM||||that sucks, but that had to look funny flying through the air.. and who said fiero rebodies couldn't fly?<P>------------------<BR>Galen - 1988 Hawaiian Orchid Coupe Auto 4Banger - <A HREF="http://myfiero.spinrpg.com/" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero Website</A><BR>AIM: WookieeNC||||reg||1
